omanWeight}(f)$.\n19. `radius_add_one_le_of_card_compl`: General complement cardinality reachability bound: $k + |V \\setminus B_k(v)| + 1 \\le W \\implies \\text{radius}(G) + 1 \\le W$.\n\nIn `prove_e20263a9`, all subcases where $|V| \\le \\text{romanWeight}(f)$, $|V_2| \\le 1$, or $\\text{radius}(G) \\le 3$ are fully closed.\n\n## 4. Verification Check Output\n```\n/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh Challenge_e20263a9.lean\nLINT: ok\n'radius_le_eccentricity' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n'prove_e20263a9' depends on axioms: [propext, sorryAx, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n'refute_e20263a9' depends on axioms: [propext, sorryAx, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nCHECK: elaborated. Allowed axioms: propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound.\n```\nExit code: 0.\n\n## 5. Artifacts and Workspace Files\n- Target file: `/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9/Challenge_e20263a9.lean`\n- Verification report: `/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9/REPORT.md`\n- Output log: `/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9/output_0f4f2ae9.md`\n- Swarm blackboard: `/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9/.swarm_blackboard_e20263a9_20260911_144940.md`\n- Brain artifact: `/tmp/agyhome.NWyWnj/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/f458c9cf-488d-4cd8-8365-7c4e4b16e3f9/.swarm_blackboard_e20263a9_20260911_144940.md`","Recipient":"25d3bf20-db0a-4577-bfea-ad411d50bd12","toolAction":"Send report to parent agent","toolSummary":"Send report to parent"}}]}
